  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TdH Barntrafficking III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TdH Child Trafficking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Terre des Hommes har arbetat mot barn-handel i Albanien (till Grekland/Italien)med Sida-st&#xf6;d och med gott resultat. Nu har de b&#xf6;rjat arbeta i Kosovo f&#xf6;r att stoppa barnhandel fr&#xe5;n Albanien till Kosovo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Terre des Hommes has successfully worked with anti-child-trafficking from Albania to Greece and Italy, with Sida-support. Now they work to prevent child-trafficking from Albania to Kosovo.</narrative>
  </description>
